  "description": "A feared black market arms dealer and a formidable fighter. Rugal began the forbidden ritual in order to achieve his full resurrection in earnest. As he did so, the land beneath his feet began to warp, with earth turning into water and water to earth. Amazed, he wondered to himself if this was indeed the power of the gods. However, Rugals's power was gradually fading and he would soon be unable to continue the ritual. Frustrated at his weakened body, he opened the gate to call forth sacrifices. As the first of his victims tumbled through the gate, Rugal smiled. It was time to fulfill his mission in earnest.",
